valve checked operative)</title><procitem layer="1" lid="N.00009194.0003001.004"><title>During cockpit preparation</title><procbody lid="N.00009194.0003001.005"><action-block lid="N.00009194.0003001.006"><action layer="1" lid="N.00009194.0003001.007" memory="false"><cr-action code="00009194.0003001.002"><challenge><tech-label type="pb-sw">HOT AIR</tech-label> (on the AIR COND overhead panel)</challenge><response>OFF then on</response></cr-action></action><action layer="1" lid="N.00009194.0003001.008" memory="false"><command code="00009194.0003001.003"><para layer="1" lid="N.00009194.0003001.009">On the <tech-label type="s-page">COND</tech-label>, check that the hot air pressure regulating valve follows the <tech-label type="pb-sw">HOT AIR</tech-label> command.</para></command></action></action-block></procbody></procitem><procitem layer="1" lid="N.00009194.0003001.011"><title>In flight</title><procbody lid="N.00009194.0003001.012"><condition at-any-time="false" code="00009194.0003001.005" direct="false" layer="1" lid="N.00009194.0003001.013" subtitle="false" type="cond"><intro>If affected zone temperature becomes uncomfortable: </intro><procbody lid="N.00009194.0003001.014"><action layer="1" lid="N.00009194.0003001.015" memory="false"><cr-action code="00009194.0003001.006"><challenge><tech-label type="pb-sw">HOT AIR</tech-label> (on the AIR COND overhead panel)</challenge><response>OFF</response></cr-action></action></procbody></condition></procbody></procitem></opsproc>